-- Fierce Shot lets you *choose* whether to use Strength instead of Dexterity for ranged
-- attacks, so the override must never make the attack worse. The status lives on the
-- weapon, but boost conditions still resolve context.Source to the wielder, so the
-- wielder's ability scores can be compared here (see SHILLELAGH for the same trick).

function FierceShot(entity)
	entity = entity or context.Source
	return ConditionResult(GetModifier(entity.Strength) >= GetModifier(entity.Dexterity))
end
